WEBVTT

00:03:30.832 --> 00:03:34.475
Now that groupers and snappers
are woefully overfished,

00:03:34.499 --> 00:03:36.912
fishermen are targeting parrotfish.

00:03:36.936 --> 00:03:39.348
Spearfishing took out the large species,

00:03:39.372 --> 00:03:43.650
midnight blue and rainbow parrotfish
are now exceedingly rare,

00:03:43.674 --> 00:03:46.974
and nets and traps are scooping up
the smaller species.

00:03:46.998 --> 00:03:50.677
As both a marine biologist
and a single person,

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:51.939
I can tell you,

00:03:51.963 --> 00:03:54.413
there aren't that many fish in the sea.

00:03:54.437 --> 00:03:55.534
(Laughter)

00:03:55.558 --> 00:03:58.724
And then, there's my love for their home,

00:03:58.748 --> 00:03:59.923
the coral reef,

00:03:59.947 --> 00:04:03.393
which was once as vibrant
as Caribbean cultures,